{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/a480ea1f30596446a20f9b6dd54aeb27.webp?t=1733762873\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Anterris and capture wild creatures known as Antera. The game features a vast open world for players to explore, allowing them to travel by land, air, or sea while discovering a world teeming with creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/6c1d80f9f8d164961366b2e6a5c04e39.poster.avif?t=1733762873\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/6c1d80f9f8d164961366b2e6a5c04e39.webm?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/6c1d80f9f8d164961366b2e6a5c04e39.mp4?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/253e8e95eadb3a213fa6ded42e2502e2.webp?t=1733762873\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your creatures anytime and defeat enemies in fast-paced RPG combat! Each Antera has unique spells and ultimates unlocked as they level up! Switch between creatures on the fly as you form the ultimate battle squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/70890a2abffae3aba38da606c88b27d3.poster.avif?t=1733762873\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/70890a2abffae3aba38da606c88b27d3.webm?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/70890a2abffae3aba38da606c88b27d3.mp4?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/b3e633cbdeefe7436a203198e629926e.webp?t=1733762873\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can level up each Antera creature and gain increased stats and powerful ultimate abilities. Defeating dungeons drop powerful artifacts that can uniquely alter the spells and abilities of each Antera!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/fa194d95449a44839786e2bd44a61c89.poster.avif?t=1733762873\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/fa194d95449a44839786e2bd44a61c89.webm?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/fa194d95449a44839786e2bd44a61c89.mp4?t=1733762873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657580/extras/d79637f5da1fd418fc4bfda17ecc988a.webp?t=1733762873\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join friends inside dungeons to defeat challengi